### Real-Time Order Tracker & Live Support System - API Test Suite
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check (Deliverable 21)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. REST API: Get Products Catalog (Deliverable 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products

### 3. REST API: Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders

### 4. REST API: Filter Orders by Customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?customerId=cust_01

### 5. REST API: Filter Orders by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?status=pending

### 6. REST API: Create New Order (Deliverable 1, Step 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust_01",
  "customerName": "Alex Johnson",
  "customerEmail": "alex.johnson@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "sample_p1",
      "name": "TitanPulse Pro ANC Headphones",
      "price": 249.99,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 249.99,
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "100 University Ave, Apt 4B",
    "city": "Palo Alto",
    "state": "CA",
    "zip": "94301"
  }
}

### 7. REST API: Update Order Status (PATCH) (Deliverable 1, Step 5)
# Replace {{orderId}} with actual ID from create order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "shipped",
  "note": "Package picked up by carrier courier",
  "updatedBy": "Agent Marcus Ray"
}

### 8. JSON-RPC 2.0: Cancel Order (Mandatory Deliverable 3, Step 12)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "cancelOrder",
  "params": {
    "orderId": "YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE",
    "reason": "Customer requested cancellation via JSON-RPC"
  },
  "id": 1
}

### 9. JSON-RPC 2.0: Get Order Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "getOrder",
  "params": {
    "orderId": "YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE"
  },
  "id": 2
}

### 10. JSON-RPC 2.0: Get Order Status
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "getOrderStatus",
  "params": {
    "orderId": "YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE"
  },
  "id": 3
}

### 11. JSON-RPC 2.0: Invalid Method Test (Expect Error -32601)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "unknownMethodName",
  "params": {},
  "id": 4
}

### 12. Server-Sent Events (SSE) Stream (Deliverable 4, 7)
# Run in terminal: curl -N -H "Accept: text/event-stream" http://localhost:5000/events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events
Accept: text/event-stream
